    Component {
      Type          Subsystem
      Name          "Current-vector control"
      Show          on
      Position      [250, 100]
      Direction     up
      Flipped       off
      LabelPosition south
      Frame         [-50, -30; 50, 30]
      SampleTime    "-1"
      CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
      CodeGenTarget "Generic"
      MaskType      "VectorControlSystem (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Speed control of an induction machine drive with current-vector control (VectorControlSystem with CurrentVectorController and SpeedController). Each class of motulator is a block with a mask of its arguments. The top-level blocks refer to the variables of the model initialization, and the blocks inside them get their parameters as in the constructors of motulator. T_s is the sampling period of the measurements. The input enable is the gate enable (ControlSystem.set_enable): while it is zero, the control system runs in standby for the blocked gates, computing its standby output without measuring the converter voltage, as in motulator."
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
        Variable      "par"
        Prompt        "par: Machine model of the control system (struct)"
        Type          FreeText
