      MaskDescription "Flying start of a sensorless drive after the release of the gates (VectorControlSystem.get_feedback): the first output after the release is the zero vector, applied in the next sampling period, and the estimates are initialized from the current response at the end of that period. The output step is 1 while the gates are blocked, 2 when the zero vector is computed, 3 when the zero-voltage period starts, and 0 otherwise. The output zero_torque flags the zero torque reference, while the gates are blocked and at step 2."
