    Component {
      Type          Subsystem
      Name          "CurrentReferenceGenerator"
      Show          on
      Position      [665, 75]
      Direction     up
      Flipped       off
      LabelPosition south
      Frame         [-50, -35; 50, 35]
      SampleTime    "-1"
      CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
      CodeGenTarget "Generic"
      MaskType      "CurrentReferenceGenerator (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Current reference generator with field weakening (CurrentReferenceGenerator). The inputs are the torque reference, the unlimited voltage reference ref.u_s and the DC-bus voltage meas.u_dc for the field weakening, and the rotor flux estimate fbk.psi_R. The outputs are the limited torque reference and the current reference, transformed to the coordinates of the feedback signals (CurrentVectorController.compute_output). The torque reference is zero if the input zero_torque is set (while the gates are blocked and at the flying start). The machine model par is a struct with the fields n_p, R_s, R_R, L_sgm, and L_M of InductionMachineInvGammaPars."
      MaskInit      "% Fields of the machine model par (InductionMachineInvGammaPars) for the\n% C-Script\npar_n_p = par.n_p;\npar_R_s = par.R_s;\npar_R_R = par.R_R;\npar_L_sgm = par.L_sgm;\npar_L_M = par.L_M;\n"
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
        Variable      "par"
        Prompt        "par: Machine model (InductionMachineInvGammaPars) as a struct"
        Type          FreeText
