      MaskDescription "2DOF PI current controller (CurrentController). The inputs are the current reference and the feedback signals fbk (the current fbk.i_s, and the realized voltage fbk.u_s and the angular speed fbk.w_c of the coordinates for the integral state), and the output is the voltage reference. The machine model par is a struct with the fields n_p, R_s, R_R, L_sgm, and L_M of InductionMachineInvGammaPars."
      MaskInit      "% Fields of the machine model par (InductionMachineInvGammaPars) for the\n% C-Script\npar_n_p = par.n_p;\npar_R_s = par.R_s;\npar_R_R = par.R_R;\npar_L_sgm = par.L_sgm;\npar_L_M = par.L_M;\n"
